{"3843130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Astrobound", "steam_appid": 3843130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚀 Astrobound</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journey-driven space survival adventure where every crew member, choice, and encounter can change the outcome of your voyage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic trail-style journey games, Astrobound sends you on an adventure across a galaxy filled with unpredictable events, strange species, and tough decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your ship. Lead your crew. Survive the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843130/extras/a98118b98ac93c97d31257c77bac6017.poster.avif?t=1786388901\" width=600 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843130/extras/a98118b98ac93c97d31257c77bac6017.webm?t=1786388901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843130/extras/a98118b98ac93c97d31257c77bac6017.mp4?t=1786388901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌌 A Reactive Space Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run unfolds differently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounters are randomized—but heavily shaped by:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The condition of your ship</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skills and flaws of your crew</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The region of space you're traveling through</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The consequences of earlier decisions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two journeys are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843130/extras/0afb4d530b533dd1af524db14ccfc817.poster.avif?t=1786388901\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843130/extras/0afb4d530b533dd1af524db14ccfc817.webm?t=1786388901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843130/extras/0afb4d530b533dd1af524db14ccfc817.mp4?t=1786388901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚀 Keep Your Ship Alive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship is your lifeline.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage fuel, food, and hull integrity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Install upgrades to prepare for future dangers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from different ship types with unique strengths</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preparation matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843130/extras/054a656611e3057302f9a875161d239d.poster.avif?t=1786388901\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843130/extras/054a656611e3057302f9a875161d239d.webm?t=1786388901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843130/extras/054a656611e3057302f9a875161d239d.mp4?t=1786388901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👩‍🚀 Recruit and Manage a Unique Crew</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your crew is your greatest strength—and your biggest risk.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each crew member has a skill that provides advantages</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each also carries a flaw that can create complications</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep them fed and reasonably happy… or they may leave</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a variety of species across the galaxy, from disciplined scientists to robotic entities that never eat—but can still break down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843130/extras/31f1bd189572f9c5b7c00bf57447dae9.poster.avif?t=1786388901\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843130/extras/31f1bd189572f9c5b7c00bf57447dae9.webm?t=1786388901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843130/extras/31f1bd189572f9c5b7c00bf57447dae9.mp4?t=1786388901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🪐 Explore Planets and Stations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planets serve as checkpoints along your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shops to trade supplies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Garages to repair and upgrade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lounges to hire crew</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Academies to train skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wilds to gather resources through minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planet-specific encounters that can be triggered—or avoided</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843130/extras/41c829a266a04a9eb837bac358ee3531.poster.avif?t=1786388901\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843130/extras/41c829a266a04a9eb837bac358ee3531.webm?t=1786388901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843130/extras/41c829a266a04a9eb837bac358ee3531.mp4?t=1786388901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎲 Skill-Based Minigames</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some encounters resolve through short interactive challenges:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fling your ship through space to collect supplies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve timed puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge hazards in dangerous asteroid fields</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions matter—but so does your timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843130/extras/e8855036d7f2dc43091159684b29dbde.poster.avif?t=1786388901\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843130/extras/e8855036d7f2dc43091159684b29dbde.webm?t=1786388901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843130/extras/e8855036d7f2dc43091159684b29dbde.mp4?t=1786388901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔁 Designed for Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astrobound is built around:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic crew combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching outcomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varying ship builds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run tells a different story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠️ Ongoing Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astrobound is actively in development, with a playable demo planned once core systems are fully locked in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No generative AI is used to create art, audio, or written content in Astrobound — everything is created by humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist to follow development and stay updated on future announcements.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚀 Astrobound</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journey-driven space survival adventure where every crew member, choice, and encounter can change the outcome of your voyage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic trail-style journey games, Astrobound sends you on an adventure across a galaxy filled with unpredictable events, strange species, and tough decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your ship. Lead your crew. Survive the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843130/extras/a98118b98ac93c97d31257c77bac6017.poster.avif?t=1786388901\" width=600 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843130/extras/a98118b98ac93c97d31257c77bac6017.webm?t=1786388901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843130/extras/a98118b98ac93c97d31257c77bac6017.mp4?t=1786388901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌌 A Reactive Space Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run unfolds differently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounters are randomized—but heavily shaped by:</p><ul cl